  "lines_iast": [
   "tato viṣaṇṇaṃ samavekṣya sainya̭ṃ vibhīṣaṇo buddhimatāṃ variṣṭhaḥ",
   "uvāca śākhāmṛgarājavīrāṋ āśvāsayannapratimairvacobhiḥ"
